 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span> <span class=\"refch\">866 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">φάος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">154 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">φῶς,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rhes.</span> <span class=\"refch\">447, etc. ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">φέγγος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pers.</span> <span class=\"refch\">377 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">El.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">380 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Hec.</span> <span class=\"refch\">248 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">φλόξ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">22 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">I.T.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1207,</span> l’éclat, les flambeaux, la\nlumière, la flamme du soleil ; <span class=\"grec\">ἡλίου\nβολαί,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Or.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1259,</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">172 ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">τόξα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.f.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1090,</span> les traits, les\nflèches du soleil ; <span class=\"grec\">ἁλίου ἅρμα,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Or.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1007,</span> le char du soleil ; <span class=\"grec\">ἡλίου θάλπος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Cycl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">540 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">θάλπη,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Sept.</span> <span class=\"refch\">446 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">καύματα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">O.C.</span> <span class=\"refch\">350,</span> la\nchaleur du 